sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Server (every 5 s)
  participant H as Target host over SSH
  participant G as GraphStore
  participant E as Engines (Rules, ML, Hybrid)
  participant R as IncidentManager
  participant U as Dashboard
  S->>H: docker ps, inspect, stats
  H-->>S: states, IPs, CPU, memory, restarts
  S->>H: read /proc/PID/net/tcp per container
  H-->>S: socket tables (ESTABLISHED, TIME_WAIT)
  S->>G: orient each socket (listen port), merge edges, update weights
  G->>E: readings x_s(t), container facts, graph
  par three engines on the same readings
    E->>E: Rules score and line
  and
    E->>E: load factor, residual levels, walk, forecast
  and
    E->>E: Fused Hybrid rule
  end
  E->>R: verdict of the active engine
  R->>R: rank, cascade risk, fault type, runbook
  R->>U: incident.updated, graph-update (WebSocket)
